1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:02,320
(Sheldon:)Well, first, I think the fact

2
00:00:02,476 --> 00:00:07,016
(Sheldon:)that you use your birthday
as a password is embarrassing.

3
00:00:08,382 --> 00:00:09,652
(Raj:)Thank you.

4
00:00:11,318 --> 00:00:13,028
(Penny:)Second...

5
00:00:13,187 --> 00:00:15,187
(Sheldon:)I thought your paper was inspired.

6
00:00:16,390 --> 00:00:18,700
(Arthur:)Oh, well, that...
that means a lot to me.

7
00:00:19,593 --> 00:00:20,863
(Sheldon:)Can I invite you in for tea?

8
00:00:21,428 --> 00:00:24,428
No, no. I really... I have to run.

9
00:00:24,598 --> 00:00:25,698
(Penny:)Hey, Arthur. How are you?

10
00:00:25,866 --> 00:00:27,676
(Arthur:)Well, I guess one cup wouldn't hurt.

11
00:00:36,677 --> 00:00:37,777
(Howard:)Hey, buddy, what's up?

12
00:00:37,945 --> 00:00:40,585
(Raj:)Well, I was feeling bad
about how I acted the other night

13
00:00:40,748 --> 00:00:42,888
(Raj:)so I made you a little something.

14
00:00:43,050 --> 00:00:45,550
(Howard:)-You didn't have to do that.
-Well, it was fun.

15
00:00:45,719 --> 00:00:47,889
I used some of the jewelry techniques
you taught us.

16
00:00:51,025 --> 00:00:53,865
it's a lightsaber belt buckle.

17
00:00:55,095 --> 00:00:56,805
(Howard:)This is so cool. Thanks.

18
00:00:56,964 --> 00:01:02,024
It gets better.

